The engineer's shelf (corpus-tech/) includes material derived from thirteen
third-party works, each under its own licence. No text of any of them is
committed; corpus-tech/manifest.yaml names every work with its authors, source
URL, licence and the page where the work states it.

    corpus-tech/toc/*.json      the chapter titles of each work, as published
    corpus-tech/cards/sre-book.md, sre-workbook.md, swe-at-google.md
                                structure cards of the three CC BY-NC-ND 4.0
                                works: title, chapter list and the description
                                on the site that publishes the work online,
                                reproduced verbatim and attributed, unmodified
    corpus-tech/cards/*.md (the other ten)
                                book cards written by a language model from the
                                work: adaptations, each under its work's licence
                                (CC BY 4.0 or MIT; the OWASP Top 10 for LLM
                                Applications card is CC BY-SA 4.0), stated with a
                                link and an adaptation notice in its front matter

The per-work licences and what may be done with each are in
corpus-tech/README.md.
